{"completed": true, "response": "他舍不得因为这点新冒出来的紧张，把之前好不容易得到的快乐弄坏。再说，对方本来就没答应过他什么，他只想好好喜欢对方，也怕对方觉得自己是在催着他给个准话。\n\n于是他试着想开一点。他告诉自己，真正在乎一个人，没必要每件事都等着对方给出同样的表示。能关心对方，能为对方做点事，能打心底里替对方高兴，这些本来就是真真切切的快乐，他又何必非要再向对方要一句保证呢？\n\n这么想不是在哄自己。他确实因此轻松了些。之前那点想弄清对方到底怎么想的紧张，慢慢淡了下去，他反倒更愿意对对方好了，付出多少也懒得细算。多对对方好一点，他也没那么担心会显得自己更在乎了。\n\n他能这样发自内心、心甘情愿地喜欢对方，心里觉得很幸福。他肯大大方方地喜欢对方，心里也充实了许多，仿佛他一直小心收着的温柔，终于可以好好地给对方了。\n\n那阵子，他甚至相信，自己已经找到了一种跟对方亲近、又不会伤到对方的办法：只要自己不向对方提要求，就能尽情地爱对方，也不会失去什么。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ba3123ff-c0b0-4d58-a725-c4f83ac95e53", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002233064829Z", "elapsed_seconds": 120.125, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:24:33.192044+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3c747a606d35b6967c2f6a9ee51a9ca2f917af86ae75ae7aa8fa615212009b8d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c15